abla\chi+c^{-2}\partial_t\varphi-c^{-2}\partial_t^2\chi=G+\Delta\chi-c^{-2}\partial_t^2\chi=G-W\chi=0$ on $\mathbb R^3	imes(t_0,T)$, using $\Delta\chi=\operatorname{div}
abla\chi$ and the linearity of $\operatorname{div}$ and $\partial_t$.
